    {
      "name": "4. Lab 4 - logs, metrics and the Message Broker",
      "description": "Needs the broker's port published in the Compose file (message-broker: ports \"8100:8000\"); {{broker_url}} defaults to http://localhost:8100. These requests go straight to the Message Broker, because /logs, /metrics and /events are internal routes the Gateway does not expose. Run the three round-robin requests back to back and alone.\n\nMANUAL, circuit breaker in the broker (grade 4): docker kill one replica of server-rules-service, then call 'Broker round-robin' a few times. Every call stays 200 (the broker retries on the live replica); docker compose logs message-broker shows 'Circuit breaker OPEN' and the removal from Service Discovery.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Logs - download the log file (Lab 4, grade 3)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('is a downloadable text file', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get('Content-Disposition')).to.include('attachment');",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get('Content-Disposition')).to.include('.log');",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get('Content-Type')).to.include('text/plain');",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('contains log lines', () => pm.expect(pm.response.text()).to.match(/INFO|WARN|ERROR/));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{broker_url}}/forward/server-rules-service/logs",
              "host": [
                "{{broker_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "forward",
                "server-rules-service",
                "logs"
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Logs - last 5 lines (?tail=5)",
